Ported code removed. From 2026-10 to 2026-11-08 this repository carried a port, with provenance, of the network
engine of saulpatinojr/Work-Cloud_Network_Core at commit 5d3b914 (the former HCW-NetworkEyes_App), whose MIT
relicensing was marked [REVIEW REQUIRED] here. That port, its provenance table and its `# Ported from …` headers were
deleted on 2026-11-08 (docs/adr/ADR-0006-the-engine-wheel-is-the-only-engine.md); they remain in git history. The
engine now comes from the network-assessment-azure-engine wheel released by saulpatinojr/HCW-NetworkEyes_App and
installed as a dependency under that package's own licence (its metadata declares Apache-2.0); no engine source is
distributed in this repository.

Bundled engine: network-assessment-azure-engine. The container image of this lab edition installs that wheel, and its
label org.opencontainers.image.licenses says "MIT AND Apache-2.0" for the Hybrid Cloud Works code in it: this
repository's code is MIT, the engine is Apache-2.0. The base image, Python and the other installed packages keep their
